            <ArticleTitle>Patient and observer scar assessment scale: how good is it?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>171-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This is the only scar assessment tool to include a component for patients to fill in. The few studies that investigated the effectiveness of this scale have found that it is a reliable, valid and feasible tool that is well suited for everyday practice.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
